<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Dear&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: yellow; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">[Insert Name]</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">,</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121">Allow me to
personally thank you for your service. Your blood drive collected&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; background: yellow;">[drive’s collected
units]</span>&nbsp;units, and that means more life, more love, more memories
for the most vulnerable patients in our community—those suffering unexpected
trauma and chronic illness every day. It was a pleasure to partner with you and
your colleagues, and we’re so happy to have you in our American Red Cross
family.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121">Since donation
is the only source of lifesaving blood for patients, and few organizations can
provide the impact that&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; background: yellow;">[Company Name]</span>&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#212121">can, we hope you’ll enjoy the pride of your efforts and join us
again. The need for blood is ongoing and we can’t sustain patients in need
without partners like you.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#212121"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121">To discuss <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[maximizing your upcoming drive]
[building your annual blood program] [any feedback about your recent drive],</span>
please don’t hesitate to contact me. We honor your service and support of
patients by always seeking ways to improve the experience and we value your
feedback.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121">Thank you again,
and I look forward to hearing from you soon. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:
yellow">[Insert Name]</span><o:p></o:p></p><br></p>]]></td>
